WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.210
Congratulations. I haven't talked

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:02.650
to you since you got married.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.729
Good for you.

00:00:03.729 --> 00:00:05.978
(applause)

00:00:05.978 --> 00:00:08.228
(applause)

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.120
Funny is that you and
your wife are staying

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.600
at the hotel in Ojai close
to where I got married.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.970
We accidentally drove smack dab

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.020
into your wedding because
my wife's involved

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.640
in something called the
Ojai Playwrights contest

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.700
a contest, conference.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.160
And we went up there to be part of that.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.270
We had no idea. We get there.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.490
There's paparazzi helicopters everywhere.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:32.984
I thought, I don't think that's for me.

00:00:32.984 --> 00:00:33.817
(laughter)

00:00:33.817 --> 00:00:34.650
It might be.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:35.684
Yeah, no, not really.

00:00:35.684 --> 00:00:36.517
(imitates paparazzi) O'Brien's headed

00:00:36.517 --> 00:00:37.619
(imitates paparazzi) to the
playwright's conference.

00:00:37.619 --> 00:00:38.837
(imitates paparazzi) Get him.

00:00:38.837 --> 00:00:40.260
It was madness.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.060
All of Ojai was complete madness

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.560
and we were right in the middle of it.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.550
Well, yeah, and I mean, I heard that.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.870
I, you know, I heard that
a couple of my friends were

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.490
you know, we, you know,
we had a really good time.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:54.150
And then the night of the,
the, the party, they went back

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.620
to the hotel and one of my friends saw you

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:00.660
and he maybe had had a
little bit too much to drink

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.810
and maybe enjoying himself too much.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:03.927
And apparently he was like

00:01:03.927 --> 00:01:05.817
(drunk scream) Conan! How are you?

00:01:05.817 --> 00:01:08.510
And you were so nice and
sweet as you are to everybody.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:10.360
And he would just try and , hi

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.470
how are you so nice to meet you?

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.156
And literally his response was

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:15.558
BAAAALLLLLALALALLLLAAALL!

00:01:15.558 --> 00:01:17.000
(laughter)

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.377
It's true. This guy came up to me.

00:01:19.377 --> 00:01:23.560
He is the drunkest adult male
I've ever seen in my life.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.230
(laughter)

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.876
And he was weaving back and forth.

00:01:27.876 --> 00:01:30.690
(drunk screaming) CONAN!

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.730
So I started to talk to him.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.460
Yea. So nice to see you when
you were here for recent

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.500
isn't that nice that they
got, and at one point

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.640
for no reason, he looked like
he zoned out for a little bit.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.020
And then at one reason,
I'm not making this up.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.430
I thought he almost
passed out for a minute.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:43.623
And then he woke up and he just went,

00:01:43.623 --> 00:01:45.143
BULLSHIT!

00:01:45.143 --> 00:01:47.460
(laughter)

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:48.313
For no reason.

00:01:52.772 --> 00:01:54.080
And then they were all throughout the town

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.880
the whole weekend. Everywhere.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.160
with incredible hangovers.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:57.993
We called her the next day.

00:01:57.993 --> 00:01:58.826
And we say, well

00:01:58.826 --> 00:02:00.440
the good news is you
probably won't remember

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.480
but the bad news is you don't remember

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.080
the good news is you won the wedding.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.349
Yea, you won.

00:02:05.349 --> 00:02:06.182
You won. You're the winner.

00:02:06.182 --> 00:02:07.880
Yeah. You're the biggest partier.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.430
The other crazy thing is
every single paparazzi person

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:13.840
in the world showed up to
get a photograph of you.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.810
And so they wanted to get photographs

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.910
of all the people who
were at the wedding too.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.166
So I'm walking along

00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:20.344
(mimics unaware Conan)

00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:21.504
and they kept saying,

00:02:21.504 --> 00:02:23.000
Conan, how was the wedding?

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:23.833
How was the wedding?

00:02:23.833 --> 00:02:25.150
And I kept saying, I'm
not going to the wedding.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:25.999
I'm going to the

00:02:25.999 --> 00:02:28.326
(nerd voice) OJAI Playwrights conference.

00:02:28.326 --> 00:02:30.224
Typical nerd.

00:02:30.224 --> 00:02:32.710
(nerd voice) Would you
like to come with me?

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.640
They kept asking me.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.500
And finally, there were
these guys, I think they were

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.534
from Germany or somebody who like,

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:37.700
(German accent) How vas the Vedding?

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.790
And I just said, it was amazing.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:40.880
It was great.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.853
And I said, I was the ring bearer.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.282
And I saw these guy go,

00:02:45.282 --> 00:02:47.449
ah, he is the ring bearer.

